*~

# ── Internal design notes (not user-facing) ──────────────────
learning-coach-design-doc.md

# ── Course & project workspaces (personal study/build data) ──
# courses/ contains session logs, quiz records, source materials,
# and progress data. projects/ contains long-running personal build
# workspaces (e.g., MLOps build-along, CIFAR-10 build-along). Both
# are private and must not be published to the public template repo.
#
# Students who want to track their own progress in a private fork
# can remove these lines from their personal copy of .gitignore.
courses/
projects/

# ── Root-level files left over from /init-coach test runs ────
# Leading "/" anchors to the repo root only — otherwise these patterns also
# ignore the templates under starter-files/, which broke the template repo
# (a fresh clone had no starter files for /init-coach to copy).
# The root CLAUDE.md is the static dispatcher — it IS committed.
/memory.md
/progress.md
/cheatsheet.md
/misses.md
/cases.md
/SOURCES.md
/DIAGNOSTIC.md
/CALIBRATION.md

# ── Node (if ever adding a build step — v1 has none) ─────────
node_modules/
